sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser
    participant Frontend as workspaces-frontend<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Backend as workspaces-backend<br/>4000/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAuth as Kubernetes API<br/>TokenReview
    participant K8sAuthz as Kubernetes API<br/>SubjectAccessReview
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as workspaces-controller

    Note over Browser,Controller: Flow 1: User Creates Workspace via UI

    Browser->>Frontend: HTTP GET /index.html<br/>Gateway-terminated TLS
    Frontend-->>Browser: React SPA

    Browser->>Backend: POST /api/v1/workspaces/:namespace<br/>Bearer Token or kubeflow-userid header
    Backend->>K8sAuth: TokenReview<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAuth-->>Backend: User Identity
    Backend->>K8sAuthz: SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAuthz-->>Backend: Authorized
    Backend->>K8sAPI: Create Workspace CR<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-kubeflow-org-v1beta1-workspace<br/>HTTPS/9443 TLS 1.2+
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission Response
    K8sAPI-->>Backend: Workspace Created
    Backend-->>Browser: 201 Created

    Note over Controller,K8sAPI: Flow 2: Controller Reconciles Workspace

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch Workspace<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Workspace Event
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Get WorkspaceKind<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: WorkspaceKind Spec
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update StatefulSet<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceAccount<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update RoleBinding<br/>HTTPS/6443 TLS 1.2+
